  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Women Entrepreneurship Program - Reminaged (AWEP-R): Hatua Project-Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vikapu Bomba Hatua Project entails the expansion of basket weaving business that will directly engage more than 500 rural women in Iringa Region. With a captive internal and external market, the project will generate gainful employment for 500 rural women, increase basket production to 7,500 units annually and increase in income to the rural women from $30 t0 $180 per month. Overall, the project will directly and indirectly impact more than 2,000 beneficiaries.</narrative>
  </description>
